  "all_ingredients_flat": "1 bottle gourd, 1 small beetroot, 3 medium sized carrots, 10 cloves of garlic, 2 cups of finely chopped spinach, Green chillies according to your taste, 2 cups of ragi flour, 1.5 cups of barley flour, 3 cups of kala chana besan, 1.5 cups of soy yogurt, Salt to taste, Turmeric, 2-3 tsp coriander-cumin powder, 3 Tbsp lemon juice, 2 tsp baking soda, 1 tsp sesame seeds, kala chana besan, sesame seeds, mustard seeds, curry leaves",
  "instructions": "Mix all the ingredients to make a dough. Add more kala chana besan if needed for binding. Form cylinder shape rolls & steam for 20 mins. After steaming, cut into cubes. Dry tempering of sesame seeds, mustard seeds, curry leaves. Add cubes prepared above. Toss them around for 2-3 mins. Enjoy with homemade soy yogurt!",
